<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/observedProperty> <http://schema.org/domainIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/ObservationCollection> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/observedProperty> <http://schema.org/rangeIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/ObservableProperty> .
