<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/observedProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relation linking an Observation to the property that was observed. The ObservableProperty should be a property of the FeatureOfInterest (linked by hasFeatureOfInterest) of this Observation."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/observedProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
